{
  "$comment": [
    "Curation seed for the AskCarnivore Scan Layer. HUMAN FILE, git-versioned —",
    "the cron never writes here. Built from Nick's topic↔creator mapping",
    "(16 topics × 27 creators).",
    "",
    "  list_status   CLOSED_AT_27. A new name enters only if Nick judges it",
    "                equally significant. Never propose one (Concept Base §17).",
    "  channel_id    resolved ONCE by the agent through the YouTube Data API",
    "                (channels.list?forHandle=…), then cached here forever. The",
    "                cron reads it and never re-resolves. Never scrape a page.",
    "  handle        where the id came from. COPIED BY HAND from the portal's",
    "                verified directory links — never imported across repos.",
    "  register      NOT set here. It is derived from duration at scan time",
    "                (§14.4): median per creator × topic, shorter = start.",
    "  trusted_hosts global source-list (§14.12b). A creator is scanned from",
    "                their own channel PLUS these, and nowhere else — that is",
    "                what keeps re-uploads and clip channels out without an",
    "                approval gate. A guest video counts for creator X only if X",
    "                is identifiably the speaker AND the topic matches.",
    "  pins          force to the top of a box. blocklist: exclude a video id.",
    "",
    "  excluded_from_scan  ΣΤΟΝ ROSTER, ΕΚΤΟΣ SCANNER. Παραμένουν κάρτες στο",
    "                portal και μέλη των 27 — απλώς το alias-matching δεν τους",
    "                ταιριάζει (συνεντεύξεις, συνταγές, ανενεργό κανάλι). Ο λόγος",
    "                είναι γραμμένος σε κάθε εγγραφή ώστε να μην ξανα-ανοίξει.",
    "",
    "  ΑΠΟΡΡΙΦΘΗΚΑΝ ως aliases 19/08/2026, μη τα ξαναπροτείνεις:",
    "    steps, resistant, foods to avoid — πολύ γενικά ή ελάχιστο κέρδος.",
    "    ultra processed / processed foods / junk / sodium intake / salt intake /",
    "    leg cramps / menopause / womens / omad / eating window / muscle mass —",
    "    δοκιμάστηκαν σε 5.240 πραγματικούς τίτλους και έδωσαν ΜΗΔΕΝ.",
    "    weight loss / lose weight — 126 τίτλοι, αλλά ΣΚΟΠΙΜΑ εκτός: το",
    "    fat-loss-stall είναι «κόλλησα», όχι «θέλω να αδυνατίσω». Άλλο κοινό.",
    "    bp — 0 σε 5.240 τίτλους και διφορούμενο (03/09/2026).",
    "    constipation — σύμπτωμα, όχι φυτικές ίνες· λάθος βίντεο.",
    "    sugar addiction — μηδέν οριακό κέρδος, το «sugar» τα πιάνει ήδη.",
    "",
    "Rules that outlive this file: link-out only, never rehost, never transcripts."
  ],
